---
source: crates/sb/tests/docker_control.rs
expression: "help(&[\"docker\", \"stop\", \"--help\"])"
---

  Stop Docker containers managed by Saltbox in dependency order.

  USAGE

    sb docker stop [--flags]

  FLAGS

    --color    Controls when to use color (auto)
    -h --help  Help for stop
    --ignore   Containers to ignore during stop operation (can be specified multiple times)
